    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_131960e6",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man with a large belly wearing a ballet outfit, including a pink tutu, striking a ballet pose. The text overlay reads, 'when you're not fit but you know you're still majestic af.' The overall intent of this meme is to humorously and self-deprecatingly acknowledge that one may not be physically fit or conventionally graceful, yet still possesses inner majesty or dignity. The meme uses the juxtaposition of a traditionally graceful and physically demanding activity (ballet) with a person who does not conform to the typical physical standards of that activity to create a comedic effect. The intent is not to target any specific group based on protected characteristics, nor does it contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynistic, or propagandistic content. The humor stems from the contrast between the image and the text, celebrating self-acceptance and the idea that beauty or majesty is not solely defined by physical fitness. The meme is light-hearted and does not promote harm or discrimination.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_c3c1ef9d"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
