      "instance_name": "man",
      "label": "person",
      "description": "A middle-aged man with gray hair and a beard, wearing a white ballet leotard and a pink tutu, striking a ballet pose with one leg lifted and arms extended. He has a large belly and is barefoot. The man appears to be the central subject of the image, embodying the meme's humorous contrast between physical fitness and self-perceived majesty.",
