      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "ballet",
      "label": "ballet",
      "description": "Ballet is a formalized theatrical dance form with strict techniques and costumes, traditionally associated with grace, discipline, and physical fitness. The meme uses ballet as a cultural reference point to contrast with the man's physical appearance, highlighting the humor in defying conventional standards of beauty or fitness in this context.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
