      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "self_deprecating_humor",
      "label": "self-deprecating humor",
      "description": "This is a comedic technique where individuals make fun of themselves, often to deflect criticism or to express humility. The meme relies on this concept to convey the message that the person is not physically fit but still feels majestic, using humor to soften the self-criticism.",
