      "description": "A term denoting grandeur, dignity, and awe-inspiring presence. In the context of the meme, it is used ironically to describe the person's self-perceived inner worth or confidence, despite not being physically fit or graceful in the traditional sense.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
