      "instance_name": "af",
      "label": "af",
      "description": "An internet slang abbreviation for 'as f***' or 'as fuck', used to intensify the meaning of an adjective. In this meme, 'majestic af' emphasizes the exaggerated sense of self-importance or confidence the person feels, adding to the comedic effect.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
