      "label": "physical fitness stereotype",
      "description": "The stereotype that physical fitness and grace are prerequisites for engaging in or being worthy of certain activities, such as ballet. The meme subverts this by showing a man who does not fit this stereotype but still claims majesty, highlighting the absurdity of such rigid standards.",
