      "instance_name": "ballet_technique",
      "label": "ballet technique",
      "description": "Specific movements and postures in ballet, such as the arabesque or plié, require significant physical control and flexibility. The man's attempt to mimic these techniques, despite his physical limitations, is central to the meme's humor and relies on the viewer's knowledge of ballet standards.",
