      "instance_name": "audience_id_001",
      "label": "general internet audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general internet audience familiar with internet slang, self-deprecating humor, and body positivity movements. The use of 'af' (as f***), the visual contrast of a man in a ballet costume, and the theme of self-acceptance make it accessible and relatable to people who appreciate light-hearted, humorous content that celebrates individual confidence regardless of physical appearance.",
